          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5.1 Of Questions and Statements"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.327,
            0.848,
            0.385
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Your teacher tells you that they are meeting two of their childhood friends this evening. One is 5 feet tall and the other is 6 feet tall. What is your guess as to each friend’s gender based on this information?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.385,
            0.849,
            0.461
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "You might have guessed that the 5-foot-tall person is a woman and the 6-foot-tall person is a man. There is a chance that you are wrong. But experience tells us that 5-foot-tall men and 6-foot-tall women are rare. We have seen that, more often, men are taller than women."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.461,
            0.847,
            0.5
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The above is a simple example of statistical thinking. We regularly come across statements like —"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.144,
            0.586,
            0.376,
            0.673
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Jemimah’s batting has been very consistent over the past year. We can expect a century from her in tomorrow’s match."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.087,
            0.513,
            0.906,
            0.875
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 7,
              "bbox": [
                0.087,
                0.513,
                0.906,
                0.875
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_0_image_7.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.159,
            0.717,
            0.323,
            0.804
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The population of their village has reduced by about 100 in the last decade."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.459,
            0.581,
            0.601,
            0.651
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "I take about 15 minutes to cycle from school to home."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.408,
            0.725,
            0.558,
            0.83
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Since I started to eat fruits and vegetables more frequently, I am able to run 2 km more each day."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.686,
            0.627,
            0.842,
            0.714
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "I think my pen might last for 2 more weeks; it is time to get a new one soon."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.651,
            0.766,
            0.818,
            0.821
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "David spends about 7 hours daily in the school."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
